  "Hide the tray": "隱藏托盤",
  "Holds icons, cached folder sizes and the folder's last listing, so it opens instantly next time. Hidden and marked as a system file on Windows; skipped where the folder is read-only.": "保存圖示、快取的資料夾大小與上次的清單，下次開啟即可瞬間完成。在 Windows 上為隱藏並標示為系統檔案；資料夾唯讀時會略過。",
  "Python environments, package builds and cache folders always use the central index so sidecar files cannot get bundled into packages.": "Python 環境、套件建置目錄與快取資料夾一律使用中央索引，避免索引副檔案被打包進套件。",
  "Home": "首頁",
  "How many recently opened folders the overview lists. 0 hides the section.": "概覽列出多少個最近開啟的資料夾。0 會隱藏此區塊。",
  "In this app": "此應用程式內",
  "Indexes are off. Every folder's icons, sizes and cached listing now live in one database in {place}, so that drive grows with every folder you open — that is the cost of keeping folders free of extra files.": "已關閉索引。每個資料夾的圖示、大小與快取清單現在都存放在 {place} 的單一資料庫中，因此您每開啟一個資料夾，該磁碟機就會增長——這就是讓資料夾不含額外檔案的成本。",
  "Internet shortcut": "網際網路捷徑",
