  "Off": "關閉",
  "Off by default. Turn this on to start a video as soon as its details panel opens; the play button still works when it is off.": "預設關閉。開啟後，詳細資料面板一開啟就會開始播放影片；關閉時播放按鈕仍可使用。",
  "Off means double-click, like Explorer's default. The checkbox still only selects, so a click on it never opens the entry.": "關閉表示按兩下，與檔案總管的預設相同。核取方塊仍只會選取，因此點擊它永遠不會開啟項目。",
