  "Every tag in the catalogue; add, rename, recolour or remove them here.": "目錄中的每個標籤；可在此新增、重新命名、改色或移除。",
  "Reopen closed tab": "重新開啟關閉的分頁",
  "Brings back the tab you closed last, folder and all.": "把最後關閉的分頁連同資料夾一起開回來。",
  "Could not delete the selection.": "殼層無法刪除選取的項目。",
  "Could not move the selection to the recycle bin.": "殼層無法將選取的項目移至資源回收筒。",
  "Registers this app for folder opens on this account. Explorer stays available from the context menu; on Linux this sets the inode/directory default.": "將此程式註冊為此帳戶開啟資料夾的處理程式。Explorer 仍保留在右鍵選單中；Linux 會設定 inode/directory 的預設關聯。",
