  "History": "歷史記錄",
  "Background": "背景",
  "Wallpaper": "桌布背景",
  "A picture or video behind the whole window, from the title bar to the bottom.": "整個視窗（從標題欄到底部）背後的圖片或影片。",
  "None keeps the normal dark surface. Built-in concepts are scalable SVGs; a custom picture or video is loaded from its file.": "「無」保留原本的深色表面。內建概念背景是可縮放的 SVG；自訂圖片或影片會從檔案載入。",
  "Image…": "圖片…",
