  "Blur": "模糊",
  "Saturation": "飽和度",
  "Brightness": "亮度",
  "Aurora": "極光",
  "Dunes": "沙丘",
  "Tide": "潮汐",
  "Motion": "動態",
  "Custom": "自訂",
  "Drift": "漂流",
  "Ember": "餘燼",
  "Bloom": "綻放",
  "None keeps the normal dark surface. Every built-in concept comes in the app's colour presets; your own pictures, SVGs and videos are kept in the gallery.": "「無」保留原本的深色表面。每個內建概念都有軟體全部配色變體；自訂圖片、SVG 與影片會保存在下方畫廊中。",
  "Safety": "安全性",
  "Protected folders": "受保護資料夾",
  "A path ending in ** covers every subfolder. A plain path protects only that folder, but deleting its parent is still held back. Environment variables such as %USERPROFILE% are expanded before the check.": "結尾為 ** 的路徑會涵蓋所有子資料夾；一般路徑只保護該資料夾本身，但刪除它的上層資料夾仍會被攔下。檢查前會先展開 %USERPROFILE% 這類環境變數。",
  "Includes subfolders": "包含子資料夾",
  "This folder only": "僅此資料夾",
  "Add folder…": "新增資料夾…",
  "Confirmation delay": "確認延遲",
  "The delete button in the protected-folder dialog stays disabled for this many seconds. At least 1.": "受保護資料夾對話框的刪除按鈕會停用這麼多秒，最少 1 秒。",
  "Protected folder": "受保護資料夾",
  "These paths are protected by the safety settings:": "以下路徑受到安全設定保護：",
  "Protected by {pattern}": "受到 {pattern} 保護",
  "Deletes permanently": "永久刪除",
  "Moves to the recycle bin": "移至資源回收筒",
  "Nothing has been deleted.": "尚未刪除任何內容。",
  "This waits {seconds}s before the delete button works.": "需等待 {seconds} 秒後刪除按鈕才能使用。",
  "Delete anyway ({seconds}s)": "仍要刪除（{seconds} 秒）",
  "Delete anyway": "仍要刪除",
  "Deleting a protected folder, anything inside a recursive entry, or a folder that contains one always waits for an explicit confirmation.": "刪除受保護資料夾、遞迴項目內的任何內容，或包含受保護項目的上層資料夾，一律需要明確確認。",
  "Rules are glob-like: ** covers the folder and everything below it, * covers the folder and the entries directly inside it, and a plain path covers only the folder. Environment variables such as %USERPROFILE% are expanded first.": "規則是類似 glob 的路徑：** 涵蓋資料夾本身與其下所有內容，* 涵蓋資料夾本身與直接位於其中的項目，純路徑只涵蓋資料夾本身。檢查前會先展開 %USERPROFILE% 這類環境變數。",
  "Protected path": "保護路徑",
  "The delete button in the protected-folder dialog stays disabled for this many seconds. At least 2.": "受保護資料夾對話框的刪除按鈕會停用這麼多秒，最少 2 秒。",
  "Rules are full-path globs: * stays inside one name, ** crosses folders, and ? matches one character. A rule without a folder part, such as *.log, applies to that name at any depth. %VARS%, $VARS and ~ are expanded first.": "規則是完整路徑的 glob：* 只匹配同一層名稱內的內容，** 可跨越資料夾，? 匹配單一字元。沒有資料夾部分的規則（例如 *.log）會套用到任何深度的同名檔案。檢查前會先展開 %VAR%、$VAR 與 ~。",
  "Restore defaults": "還原預設值",
  "Time format": "時間格式",
  "Format": "格式",
  "24-hour": "24 小時制",
  "12-hour": "12 小時制",
  "Pattern": "樣式",
  "Follow the system, force 24-hour or 12-hour time, or define your own pattern.": "跟隨系統，或強制使用 24／12 小時制，也可以自訂樣式。",
  "Every timestamp in the interface uses this format: follow the system, force 24-hour or 12-hour time, or define your own pattern.": "介面中的所有時間都會使用此格式：可跟隨系統、強制 24 或 12 小時制，或自訂樣式。",
  "Tokens: yyyy year, MM month, dd day, HH 24-hour, mm minute, ss second, hh 12-hour and a AM/PM. Other characters are copied.": "符號：yyyy 年、MM 月、dd 日、HH 24 小時、mm 分、ss 秒、hh 12 小時、a 上午／下午；其他字元會原樣保留。",
  "No matching items.": "沒有符合的項目。",
  "Fonts": "字體",
  "Interface": "介面",
  "Titles": "標題",
  "File names": "檔案名稱",
  "Details panel": "詳細資料面板",
  "Address bar": "網址列",
  "Monospace": "等寬字型",
  "Text preview": "文字預覽",
  "Falls back to {font} until another family is chosen.": "在選擇其他字型前使用 {font}。",
  "Filter fonts…": "篩選字型…",
  "(default)": "（預設）",
  "No matching font.": "沒有符合的字型。",
  "Back to the app's built-in font for every role.": "讓每個用途都回到應用程式內建字型。",
  "Share": "分享",
  "Share folders": "分享資料夾",
  "No folders are shared yet.": "尚未分享任何資料夾。",
  "Stop sharing": "停止分享",
  "Only paired devices can open this folder in the app.": "只有已配對的裝置可以在應用程式中開啟此資料夾。",
  "Web": "網頁",
  "App": "應用程式",
  "Any device with a browser can open this folder.": "任何有瀏覽器的裝置都可以開啟此資料夾。",
  "This folder is already shared.": "此資料夾已經在分享。",
  "Share this folder": "分享此資料夾",
  "Browser access": "瀏覽器存取",
  "Open one of these addresses on any device on the same network.": "在同一網路上的任何裝置開啟這些網址。",
  "This device": "此裝置",
  "Shared": "共享",
  "No sharing devices on this network yet. Pair one by address or share a folder from the title bar.": "網路上還沒有分享裝置。可以用位址配對，或從標題列分享資料夾。",
  "No folders are shared with the app on this device.": "此裝置沒有與應用程式分享任何資料夾。",
  "Not paired": "未配對",
  "Paired": "已配對",
  "Offline": "離線",
  "Pair": "配對",
  "Pairing…": "配對中…",
  "Pair by address": "依位址配對",
  "Address, e.g. 192.168.1.20:45701": "位址，例如 192.168.1.20:45701",
  "Pair for sharing": "配對以分享",
  "{device} wants to pair with this device for sharing folders.": "{device} 想要與此裝置配對以分享資料夾。",
  "Check that the other device shows the same code before accepting.": "接受前請確認另一台裝置顯示相同的代碼。",
  "Reject": "拒絕",
  "Accept": "接受",
  "Pairing code: {code}": "配對代碼：{code}",
  "Pairing failed.": "配對失敗。",
  "Share web server port": "分享網頁伺服器連接埠",
  "The port the browser file server listens on. Leave it empty to pick a free port between 6000 and 9000 automatically.": "瀏覽器檔案伺服器監聽的連接埠。留空會在 6000 到 9000 之間自動選擇空閒連接埠。",
  "Ridgeline": "山稜線",
  "Skyline": "城市天際線",
  "Orbit": "軌道",
  "Image or video URL": "圖片或影片網址",
  "Paste a direct http(s) link. The picture or video is loaded from the network each time the window starts.": "貼上直接的 http(s) 連結。每次開啟視窗時都會從網路載入圖片或影片。",
  "Add": "新增",
  "Add URL": "新增網址",
  "Web server port": "網頁伺服器連接埠",
  "Random asks the operating system for one free port when the first web share starts, and every web share keeps using it. Custom always tries the port below.": "隨機模式會在第一次分享 web 目錄時向作業系統取得一個空閒連接埠，之後所有 web 分享都共用它；自訂模式則固定使用下方連接埠。",
  "Random": "隨機",
  "Custom port": "自訂連接埠",
  "A number from 1 to 65535. If it is already in use the app asks for a free port instead.": "1 到 65535 的數字。若連接埠已被佔用，應用程式會改為取得空閒連接埠。",
  "Startup": "啟動",
  "How the app joins your login session, and whether it opens quietly in the tray.": "應用程式如何加入您的登入工作階段，以及是否在托盤中安靜啟動。",
  "Start with the computer": "開機時啟動",
  "A shortcut uses the Startup folder (or XDG autostart). A task uses Task Scheduler (or a systemd user service), which starts earlier and is usually faster.": "捷徑會使用「啟動」資料夾（或 XDG 自動啟動）；排程工作則使用工作排程器（或 systemd 使用者服務），啟動更早也通常更快。",
  "This platform cannot create a per-user startup entry.": "此平台無法建立每位使用者的啟動項目。",
  "Scheduled task": "排程工作",
  "Start hidden in the tray": "啟動時隱藏到托盤",
  "Launch straight to the tray icon instead of showing the window. The tray menu opens it again.": "啟動後直接縮到托盤圖示，不顯示視窗；托盤選單可再次開啟。",
  "Encrypted": "已加密",
  "Encrypted archive": "加密壓縮檔",
  "This archive is encrypted and asks for a password when opened.": "此壓縮檔已加密，開啟時會要求輸入密碼。",
  "Password required": "需要密碼",
  "Favorites": "收藏",
  "Add to favorites": "加入收藏",
  "Remove from favorites": "從收藏中移除",
  "Add file": "新增檔案",
  "Pin any file here": "在此固定任意檔案",
  "Pin any folder here": "在此固定任意資料夾",
  "No favorites yet. Right-click any file or folder and add it here.": "尚無收藏。於任何檔案或資料夾按右鍵即可加入這裡。",
  "Logs": "日誌",
  "Application logs and crash details. Open the folder here to inspect them without leaving the app.": "應用程式日誌與當機資訊。可直接在這裡開啟資料夾查看，不必離開軟體。",
  "Open log folder": "開啟日誌資料夾",
  "Pasted text": "貼上的文字",
  "Pasted image": "貼上的圖片",
  "Paste text": "貼上文字",
  "Paste image": "貼上圖片",
  "Folder:": "資料夾：",
  "Picture": "圖片",
  "Video": "影片",
  "browser preview": "瀏覽器預覽",
  "Options": "選項",
  "Nothing to transfer.": "沒有可傳輸的項目。",
  "That name is not valid.": "這個名稱無效。",
  "The entry has no parent folder.": "此項目沒有上層資料夾。",
  "An entry with that name already exists.": "已有同名項目存在。",
  "The entry is no longer there.": "此項目已不存在。",
  "The folder is no longer there.": "此資料夾已不存在。",
  "Could not find a free name for the new folder.": "找不到可用的新資料夾名稱。",
  "Could not find a free name for the new file.": "找不到可用的新檔名。",
  "There is nothing to compress.": "沒有可壓縮的項目。",
  "The destination folder is no longer there.": "目的資料夾已不存在。",
  "That archive format is not supported.": "不支援此壓縮格式。",
  "That archive name is not valid.": "壓縮檔名稱無效。",
  "That format cannot be encrypted or split.": "此格式無法加密或分割。",
  "There is nothing to delete.": "沒有可刪除的項目。",
  "The recycle bin is turned off for this volume.": "此磁碟區已關閉資源回收筒。",
  "Nothing to undo.": "沒有可復原的操作。",
  "Nothing to redo.": "沒有可重做的操作。",
  "There is nothing to copy or move.": "沒有可複製或移動的項目。",
  "The target folder is no longer there.": "目標資料夾已不存在。",
  "A folder cannot be moved into itself.": "資料夾不能移到自身內部。",
  "A drive root cannot be copied this way.": "磁碟根目錄無法用這種方式複製。",
  "Case-sensitive folders are a Windows feature.": "大小寫敏感資料夾是 Windows 功能。",
  "A link cannot be converted this way.": "連結無法用這種方式轉換。",
  "No link was given.": "未提供連結。",
  "Creating links is a Windows feature.": "建立連結是 Windows 功能。",
  "The source no longer exists.": "來源已不存在。",
  "A link copy needs a folder source.": "連結複製需要資料夾來源。",
  "The path is not inside an archive.": "此路徑不在壓縮檔內。",
  "That folder does not exist.": "此資料夾不存在。",
  "A device is required.": "需要指定裝置。",
  "The device is not paired.": "此裝置尚未配對。",
  "No URL was given.": "未提供網址。",
  "Could not open the link.": "無法開啟連結。",
  "Applying edits is currently supported for ZIP archives.": "目前僅支援套用 ZIP 壓縮檔的變更。",
  "The path does not name a file inside an archive.": "此路徑不是壓縮檔內的檔案。",
  "The file is no longer in the archive.": "此檔案已不在壓縮檔內。",
  "Could not read this file.": "無法讀取此檔案。",
  "A device address is required.": "需要裝置位址。",
  "Another pairing is already in progress.": "另一個配對正在進行中。",
  "The request id is missing.": "缺少請求 ID。",
  "A device, share and file are required.": "需要裝置、分享與檔案。",
  "This item is cut and will move when something is pasted.": "此項目已剪下，貼上時會移動。",
  "Restore default panels": "還原預設面板",
  "Put every panel back the way the app ships it": "把所有面板還原為應用程式出廠時的狀態。",
  "Resize column": "調整欄位寬度",
  "Reset column widths": "重設欄位寬度",
  "Reset widths": "重設寬度",
  "Administrator rights are required to change this folder.": "修改此資料夾需要系統管理員權限。",
  "Select all matches": "選取所有相符項目",
  "Open the file tray while dragging": "拖曳時開啟檔案托盤",
  "The tray appears when a drag starts and closes again if it is still empty. Off leaves it to the title bar button.": "開始拖曳時顯示托盤；如果拖曳結束時它仍是空的，就會自動關閉。關閉此項後只能用標題列按鈕開啟。",
  "Folders on a shared device cannot be copied yet.": "分享裝置上的資料夾暫時無法複製。",
  "The file could not be copied.": "無法複製此檔案。"
